# NEVER commit secrets. Testnet fixtures with private keys / brainkeys live
# here during verification but must stay local-only (AGENTS.md rule 7).
tooling/testnet-*.json
tooling/*secret*
tooling/*wif*
**/*brainkey*.json
/tmp/faucet-keys.json
/tmp/lite-*.txt
# Dev-only visual tooling (headless browser + deps). Never shipped, never required.
tooling/visual/node_modules/
tooling/visual/.browsers/
tooling/visual/package-lock.json
# Reference checkouts: read-only, each with its own history. Never commit them.
# Canonical home is /workspace/reference/; root symlinks preserve old paths.
# (Bare names match both the reference/ dir contents and the root symlinks.)
reference
bitshares-ui
astro-ui
wallet-extension
bitshares-core
bitshares-dex-ux
